  "content": "<p><strong>Croptopia Delight</strong>&nbsp;是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>&nbsp;的附加模組，整合了<strong>Farmer's Delight</strong>和<strong>Croptopia</strong>。</p><pre>此模組將Croptopia的食譜與Farmer's Delight及其附加模組進行整合。</pre><p>開發工作已由<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/ray_lirov\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ray_Lirov</a>領導下恢復</p><pre>您也可以使用<strong>資料包</strong>版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/croptopia-delight-dp\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a><br>我們也有Modrinth頁面：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcroptopia-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></pre><p>有問題嗎？加入我們的Discord並提問<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/M4XttfXXDw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord連結</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>尋找遊戲主機服務？我們的合作夥伴Godlike Host能幫助您！</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgodlike.host%252fminecraft-java-servers-hosting%252f%253faff_id%253d1317\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/932098/description_8a000688-8d49-42cd-9370-104cd5ac9b97.png\" width=\"575\" height=\"300\"></a></p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
